      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5411197345968701560\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C85.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e✅\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The Telegram \u003ca href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/telegram-login#native-sdks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eLogin SDK\u003c/a\u003e now supports native iOS and Android apps.\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5407025283456835913\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93B1.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📱\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5300930339886096923\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A9.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🤩\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Only Telegram lets developers verify users’ phone numbers for free — something that’s otherwise expensive. \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5305266122256300012\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FABB0.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🫰\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5774130736839791004\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8DB4.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🍴\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Expect more apps adding “Continue with Telegram\u0026#34;! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5866355487255039002\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9A80.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🚀\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
