    {
      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5202132623060640759\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F87ABF09F87B7.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🇫🇷\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Macron’s France is losing legitimacy as it weaponizes criminal investigations to \u003cb\u003esuppress free speech\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eprivacy\u003c/b\u003e. The U.S. Department of Justice \u003ca href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/04/18/justice-department-france-probe-exlon-musk-x.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003ehas refused\u003c/a\u003e to assist France in its investigation of Elon Musk, calling the case \u003cb\u003epolitically motivated\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5359441070201513074\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8EAD.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎭\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The French prosecutor’s office claims to be independent, but that is untrue: French prosecutors are hired, fired, and promoted by the government. The judicial police — who provide often misleading reports to investigative judges — are also controlled by the government.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eI’m under a \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/durov/447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003esimilar investigation\u003c/a\u003e in France: over a dozen charges, each carrying up to 10 years in prison. Proud to stand alongside Elon Musk and others targeted by Macron\u0026#39;s campaign against digital rights. In Macron’s France, being investigated is the new \u003ci\u003eLégion d’honneur\u003c/i\u003e.\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8E96.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎖\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e",
      "date": "2026-04-20T00:01:54Z",
      "edited": false,
      "edit_date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "views": 4,
      "forwards": 0,
