    {
      "id": 0,
      "message": "This is how the EU/UK now regulates social media: \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA490.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🤐\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e Offer CEOs secret deals to censor dissent. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9AA8.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🚨\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e If they refuse, open criminal cases against them.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5389048448731328224\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9891.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😑\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e When people push back, say it\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;all for the children\u0026#34;.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u0026#34;Protecting children\u0026#34; has become the standard legal/PR cover. \u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8EAD.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎭\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e",
      "date": "2026-04-20T16:25:25Z",
      "edited": false,
      "edit_date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "views": 4,
      "forwards": 0,
