    {
      "id": 0,
      "message": "France\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Agency for Secure Documents\u0026#34; was hacked. Names, addresses, emails, and phone numbers of \u003cb\u003e19 million people\u003c/b\u003e — leaked from a single government database.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eFuture leaks will be even more catastrophic if the French government gets what it wants: \u003cb\u003eaccess to encrypted chats\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eDigital IDs\u003c/b\u003e of social media users.",
